|name = Manic Lion Thunderbolt + Uber Combos
|cannon = Thunderbolt
|notes = This only works if you have two 2-slot Cannon Start Medium combos, which are restricted to Ubers. Bahamut requires an extra hit to destroy the base if he is at level 40 compared to level 50. Green Shell Cat can be substituted instead of Manic Eraser and Manic Lion, in which case you would send it out at the same timing as Manic Lion below.
}}

Send out Million-Dollar Cat, then send out a Manic Eraser around 750c. Once the Metal Hippoe dies, immediately send out Manic Lion and fire the Thunderbolt cannon as soon as it is available. As soon as Bahamut is ready, send him out and watch him beat up the entire base instead of hitting the Metal Snaches.  The timing is a bit annoying to get right, but once you master it you should be able to very consistently clear this stage.

